From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mina Her <minacle@live.com>
Date: Sun, 24 May 2026 17:07:20 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Update Yarn signing key in Dockerfile

- Install the latest Yarn package signing key into the system keyring
- Ensure repository verification succeeds during apt-get operations

Rationale: The previous GPG key has expired or become invalid, causing package installation failures; updating the key restores the integrity of the development environment's dependency management.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <copilot@github.com>

diff --git a/.devcontainer/Dockerfile b/.devcontainer/Dockerfile
index 3aa0bbf7da..46673f769e 100644
--- a/.devcontainer/Dockerfile
+++ b/.devcontainer/Dockerfile
@@ -6,6 +6,10 @@ WORKDIR /app
 COPY .nvmrc .
 RUN /bin/bash --login -i -c "nvm install"
 
+# Refresh Yarn's APT signing key before apt-get update.
+RUN curl -fsSL https://dl.yarnpkg.com/debian/pubkey.gpg | \
+    gpg --dearmor --yes -o /usr/share/keyrings/yarn-archive-keyring.gpg
+
 # Install additional OS packages
 RUN apt-get update && \
     export DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive && \
diff --git a/.devcontainer/devcontainer-lock.json b/.devcontainer/devcontainer-lock.json
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000..4ae31f2169
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.devcontainer/devcontainer-lock.json
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+{
+  "features": {
+    "ghcr.io/devcontainers/features/sshd:1": {
+      "version": "1.1.0",
+      "resolved": "ghcr.io/devcontainers/features/sshd@sha256:f5251b8e4325f68f7280973c6cd65daff414449c66f240621502d4e8e74eb7ee",
+      "integrity": "sha256:f5251b8e4325f68f7280973c6cd65daff414449c66f240621502d4e8e74eb7ee"
+    }
+  }
+}

From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mina Her <minacle@live.com>
Date: Wed, 27 May 2026 11:47:19 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Install librsvg2-bin in dev container

- Include librsvg2-bin in the Dockerfile package list
- Enable command-line support for processing SVG files

Rationale: Adding this package ensures that tools reliant on SVG conversion function correctly during development and build processes within the containerised environment.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

diff --git a/.devcontainer/Dockerfile b/.devcontainer/Dockerfile
index 46673f769e..3b5a5f05de 100644
--- a/.devcontainer/Dockerfile
+++ b/.devcontainer/Dockerfile
@@ -13,7 +13,7 @@ RUN curl -fsSL https://dl.yarnpkg.com/debian/pubkey.gpg | \
 # Install additional OS packages
 RUN apt-get update && \
     export DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive && \
-    apt-get -y install --no-install-recommends libicu-dev libidn11-dev ffmpeg imagemagick libvips42 libpam-dev
+    apt-get -y install --no-install-recommends libicu-dev libidn11-dev ffmpeg imagemagick libvips42 libpam-dev librsvg2-bin
 
 # Disable download prompt for Corepack
 ENV COREPACK_ENABLE_DOWNLOAD_PROMPT=0
